        "id": 17761,
        "name": "carnilius",
        "username": "carnilius",
        "avatar_template": "/letter_avatar_proxy/v4/letter/c/d07c76/{size}.png",
        "created_at": "2018-01-31T20:10:55.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>Unlike many of the people posting in the Single Box Solution thread, I'm extremely mechanically challenged and don't want to create my own solution to storage. &nbsp;That said, I also don't want to need to separate out all expansion materials from the power, fear, and blight card stacks. &nbsp;</p><p><span>So what's the best way of putting all the material (including the promos) back into the original two boxes without any cutting or purchase of supplies?</span></p>",
        "post_number": 1,
        "post_type": 1,
        "updated_at": "2021-02-07T01:50:54.190Z",
        "reply_count": 0,
        "reply_to_post_number": null,
        "quote_count": 0,
        "incoming_link_count": 10,
        "reads": 0,
        "readers_count": 0,
        "score": 50.0,
        "yours": false,
        "topic_id": 17760,
        "topic_slug": "two-box-solution",
        "display_username": "carnilius",
        "primary_group_name": "playtesters",
        "flair_name": "playtesters",
        "flair_url": "/uploads/default/original/1X/f46928191dbf93b4d0df24571543f49779579225.png",
        "flair_bg_color": "",
