        "can_wiki": false,
        "read": false,
        "user_title": null,
        "bookmarked": false,
        "raw": "<p>Unlike many of the people posting in the Single Box Solution thread, I&#39;m extremely mechanically challenged and don&#39;t want to create my own solution to storage. &nbsp;That said, I also don&#39;t want to need to separate out all expansion materials from the power, fear, and blight card stacks. &nbsp;</p><p><span style=\"font-size: 13px;\">So what&#39;s the best way of putting all the material (including the promos) back into the original two boxes without any cutting or purchase of supplies?</span></p>",
