        "read": false,
        "user_title": null,
        "bookmarked": false,
        "raw": "<p>I&#39;m not entirely certain the best way, but I&#39;d put all the Spirit Panels and their tokens (in baggies) in the Branch and Claw box, anbd everything else (Using baggies that came with the box for the tokens/invaders/ect) in the main. That way you can hand the branch and claw box around to players to pick spirits while someone else uses the other box to set up.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>I might get a small cardboard cardbox for the cards - you can get one for a dollar or two usually at any game store, and that would work really nicely for the cards.</p>",
